# Board meeting, September 14th, 2026

__Board members present__

* Jonatas L Nogueira (jesusalva) (Vice-President)
* Forrest Fleming (fsf)
* Jeremy Stanley (fungi)
* Milan Kupcevic (milan)
* Gordian Edenhofer (gordian)
* Michael Schultheiss (schultmc) (President)
* Katie McMillan (mappx) (Secretary)
* Héctor Orón Martínez (zumbi) (Treasurer)

__Board members partially present__

* Borden Rhodes (borden)

__Board members absent with regrets__

* none

__Board members absent__

* none

__Registered guests present__

* Célestin Matte (Perdu), contractor

These are the minutes for the September 14th, 2026 SPI Board Meeting,
held at 20:00 UTC in #spi on irc.spi-inc.org.
[LOG](../../../logs/2026/2026-09-14.txt).

## President's report
<pre>
Martin, Héctor and I have been working with our auditor to get our 2025
financial statements audited. We are also working with the auditing firm
on filing our New York State and Federal annual filings. We have received
a 6 month extension for the time to file and are confident the filings will
be completed by the November 15, 2026 deadline.
</pre>

## Vice President's report
<pre>
Everything is running within expectations. If you have a stale request it might
have been missed, so do not hesitate to bump.
</pre>

## Treasurer's report

<pre>
There are pending payments on the queue due to the big amount of requests,
those are expected to be cleared over this and the next week.

Work in progress preparing audit and F2F event.

If you have any urgency, please reach out.

Thanks very much for the continuous work of the treasurer team, including
president, vice-president and contractors.
</pre>

## Secretary's report

<pre>
I think the only thing to report this month is that I am in training, and it is
moving along well with guidance

thanks fungi
</pre>

