## Other business

* The board briefly discussed coordination around bulk booking of
  accommodations for the November in-person meeting.

* A question from an associated project was raised regarding a budget review
  for a planned crowdfunding campaign, and it was agreed to get more details
  from them by E-mail first.

## Adjournment

The meeting was adjourned until Monday October 12th, 2026 at 20:00 UTC
in #spi on irc.spi-inc.org.

